   "html": "<section class=\"hero\"><p class=\"desk-edition\">Daily refresh 2026-10-21 (SHORT Wednesday)</p><div class=\"hero-top\"><span class=\"hero-kicker\">Daily Summary</span><span class=\"badge cautious hero-regime\">Cautious</span></div><p class=\"headline\">Cautious — ETF buyers came back in size, but only through one door, and spot demand underneath is still thin.</p><ul class=\"hero-story\"><li class=\"watch\"><span class=\"st-dot\">🟡</span><span class=\"st-text\"><span class=\"st-lead\">Wednesday lens</span>Monday's BTC ETF print was about +$527M, the best day in roughly a month, with IBIT taking ~$665M while Fidelity and Grayscale bled.</span></li><li class=\"watch\"><span class=\"st-dot\">🟡</span><span class=\"st-text\"><span class=\"st-lead\">Watch</span>on-chain cycle Bearish; shorts pressing.</span></li></ul><div class=\"hero-metrics\"><div class=\"hm sig-watch\"><div class=\"lbl\">BTC</div><div class=\"val\">$82,662</div><div class=\"chg\">7d +1.3% · 30d -4.6%</div><span class=\"sig watch\">🟡 Bouncing</span><div class=\"mean\">Weekly bounce within a monthly decline.</div></div><div class=\"hm sig-neutral\"><div class=\"lbl\">ETH</div><div class=\"val\">$2,444</div><div class=\"chg\">7d +1.0% · 30d -12.0%</div><span class=\"sig neutral\">⚪ In line with BTC</span><div class=\"mean\">ETH in line with BTC this week.</div></div><div class=\"hm sig-pos\"><div class=\"lbl\">Fed liquidity</div><div class=\"val word\">↑ Improving</div><div class=\"chg\">4w improving</div><span class=\"sig pos\">🟢 Supportive</span></div><div class=\"hm sig-neg\"><div class=\"lbl\">Treasury cash</div><div class=\"val word\">↑ Rebuilding</div><div class=\"chg\">7d rebuilding · 4w falling</div><span class=\"sig neg\">🔴 Removes liquidity</span></div><div class=\"hm sig-pos\"><div class=\"lbl\">BTC ETF flows</div><div class=\"val pos\">+$364M</div><div class=\"chg\">week 13–19 Oct</div><span class=\"sig pos\">🟢 Inflows</span><div class=\"mean\">Institutions bought on 3/5 days.</di