   "html": "<section class=\"block card onchain-card\"><h2>On-chain <span class=\"tag\">BlockHorizon · Oct 19</span><span class=\"tag\">CheckOnChain</span><span class=\"tag soft\">CoC 2026-10-20</span></h2><p class=\"sec-story\">Cycle still Bearish at 32 with 4/16 bullish.</p><div class=\"oc-legend\"><span class=\"src-chip agree\">Confirmed</span><span class=\"oc-leg\">both sources align</span><span class=\"src-chip diverge\">Diverge</span><span class=\"oc-leg\">sources disagree</span><span class=\"src-chip single\">Single source</span><span class=\"oc-leg\">only one feed</span></div><div class=\"oc-hero\"><div class=\"oc-cycle\"><div class=\"label\">Cycle reading</div><div class=\"value\">Cycle 32 · Bearish</div><span class=\"sig neg\">🔴 Bearish</span></div><div class=\"oc-breadth\"><div class=\"label\">Signal breadth</div><div class=\"value\">4/16 bullish</div><span class=\"sig neg\">🔴 Weak breadth</span></div></div><div class=\"oc-extra\"><div class=\"oc-spectrum\"><div class=\"label\">Where the 16 signals sit</div><div class=\"spec-row\"><span class=\"spec-chip bottom\"><em>Bottom</em><strong>4</strong></span><span class=\"spec-chip bear\"><em>Bearish</em><strong>8</strong></span><span class=\"spec-chip bull\"><em>Bullish</em><strong>4</strong></span><span class=\"spec-chip top\"><em>Top</em><strong>0</strong></span></div><div class=\"mean\">12/16 signals in Bottom/Bearish zones.</div></div><div class=\"oc-momentum\"><div class=\"label\">30d momentum (MoM)</div><span class=\"sig neg\">🔴 Rolled over</span><div class=\"hint\">1↑ · 9→ · 6↓</div><div class=\"mean\">Month-long improvement has stalled.</div></div></div><div class=\"sig-grid\"><div class=\"hm sig-pos oc-metric-tile\"><div class=\"lbl\"><abbr class=\"gl\" title=\"Market value vs. realized value: price compared with the average cost basis of all coins. Above 1 = holders in profit on average.\" tabindex=\"0\">MVRV</abbr> <span class=\"src-chip diverge\">Diverge</span></div><div class=\"val word\">1.54</div><span class=\"sig pos\">🟢 Mild premium</span><div class=\"mean\">Holders in profit but far from euphoria.</div></div><div class=\"hm sig-pos oc-metric-tile\"><div class=\"lbl\">MVRV Z-Score <span class=\"src-chip agree\">Confirmed</span></div><div class=\"val word\">-0.21</div><span class=\"sig pos\">🟢 Below mean</span><div class=\"mean\">Z-score under zero.</div></div><div class=\"hm sig-pos oc-metric-tile\"><div class=\"lbl\">Supply in profit <span class=\"src-chip diverge\">Diverge</span></div><div class=\"val word\">70%</div><div class=\"chg\">BH 30d -10</div><span class=\"sig pos\">🟢 Majority in profit</span><div class=\"mean\">Most coins above cost.</div></div><div class=\"hm sig-pos oc-metric-tile\"><div class=\"lbl\"><abbr class=\"gl\" title=\"Net unrealized profit/loss: share of market value that is paper profit. Higher = more euphoria.\" tabindex=\"0\">NUPL</abbr> <span class=\"src-chip agree\">Confirmed</span></div><div class=\"val word\">0.35</div><span class=\"sig pos\">🟢 Optimism</span><div class=\"mean\">Moderate unrealised profits.</div></div><div class=\"hm sig-pos oc-metric-tile\"><div class=\"lbl\"><abbr class=\"gl\" title=\"Spent output profit ratio: are coins being sold at a profit (&gt;1) or loss (&lt;1)?\" tabindex=\"0\">SOPR</abbr> <span class=\"src-chip single\">CheckOnChain</span></div><div class=\"val word\">1.008</div><div class=\"chg\">7d EMA 1.008</div><span class=\"sig pos\">🟢 Mild profit-taking</span><div class=\"mean\">Coins moving at a small profit.</div></div><div class=\"hm sig-pos oc-metric-tile\"><div class=\"lbl\">Holder cost basis <span class=\"src-chip single\">CheckOnChain</span></div><div class=\"val word\"><abbr class=\"gl\" title=\"Short-term holders: coins held under ~155 days.\" tabindex=\"0\">STH</abbr> $74,612 · LTH $49,270</div><span class=\"sig pos\">🟢 Above STH</span><div class=\"mean\">Price above short-term cost ($74,612).</div></div><div class=\"hm sig-pos oc-metric-tile\"><div class=\"lbl\">Thermocap <span class=\"src-chip single\">BlockHorizon</span></div><div class=\"val word\">52 · Bullish</div><div class=\"chg\">30d flat</div><span class=\"sig pos\">🟢 Bullish</span><div class=\"mean\">Holding Bullish, flat over 30d.</div></div><div class=\"hm sig-pos oc-metric-tile\"><div class=\"lbl\">UTXOs in profit <span class=\"src-chip single\">BlockHorizon</span></div><div class=\"val word\">56 · Bullish</div><div class=\"chg\">30d -3</div><span class=\"sig pos\">🟢 Bullish</span><div class=\"mean\">Still Bullish.</div></div></div><div class=\"oc-pills\"><span class=\"oc-pills-lbl\">Category phases</span><span class=\"oc-pill risk-off\"><span class=\"oc-pill-name\">Valuation</span><span class=\"oc-pill-phase\">Bearish</span></span><span class=\"oc-pill risk-off\"><span class=\"oc-pill-name\">MVRV</span><span class=\"oc-pill-phase\">Bearish</span></span><span class=\"oc-pill risk-off\"><span class=\"oc-pill-name\">Holder</span><span class=\"oc-pill-phase\">Bearish</span></span><span class=\"oc-pill risk-off\"><span class=\"oc-pill-name\">P&amp;L</span><span class=\"oc-pill-phase\">Bearish</span></span></div></section>"
