g neutral\">⚪ Steadier</span></td><td class=\"mean-cell\">No strong push either way.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"dim-name\">Crypto trend</td><td><span class=\"sig pos\">🟢 Range, upper-middle</span></td><td class=\"mean-cell\">Supportive for risk assets.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"dim-name\">Crypto positioning</td><td><span class=\"sig watch\">🟡 Leveraged Sell-Off</span></td><td class=\"mean-cell\">Leverage-driven.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"dim-name\">Leverage</td><td><span class=\"sig watch\">🟡 Elevated, funding positive</span></td><td class=\"mean-cell\">Leverage elevated.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"dim-name\">ETF demand</td><td><span class=\"sig pos\">🟢 Inflows return, concentrated</span></td><td class=\"mean-cell\">Institutions buying.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"dim-name\">Spot demand</td><td><span class=\"sig neutral\">⚪ Weak in the US</span></td><td class=\"mean-cell\">No strong push either way.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"dim-name\">USD pressure</td><td><span class=\"sig watch\">🟡 Mixed</span></td><td class=\"mean-cell\">Dollar pressure mixed.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"dim-name\">On-chain cycle</td><td><span class=\"sig neg\">🔴 32 Bearish · 4/16</span></td><td class=\"mean-cell\">Headwind for risk assets.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"dim-name\"><abbr class=\"gl\" title=\"The Investorius rotation model (SOL/BTC allocation).\" tabindex=\"0\">RSDH</abbr></td><td><span class=\"sig pos\">🟢 BULL · SOL95/BTC5</span></td><td class=\"mean-cell\">Supportive for risk assets.</td></tr></tbody></table></section></div><section class=\"block card\"><h2>Market snapshot <span class=\"tag\">WoW · MoM</span></h2><table class=\"data\"><thead><tr><th>Indicator</th><th class=\"num\">Level</th><th class=\"num\">WoW</th><th class=\"num\">MoM</th><th>Signal</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\"dim-name\">BTC</td><td class=\"num\">$82,662</td><td class=\"num pos\" title=\"7d\">+1.33%</td><td class=\"num neg\">-4.56%</td><td><span class=\"sig watch sm\">🟡 Bouncing</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"dim-name\">ETH</td><td class=\"num\">$2,443.78</td><td class=\"num pos\" title=\"7d\">+1.05%</td><td class=\"num neg\">-11.99%</td><td><span class=\"sig watch sm\">🟡 Bouncing</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"dim-name\"><abbr class=\"gl\" title=\"US dollar index.\" tabindex=\"0\">DXY</abbr></td><td class=\"num\">101.78</td><td class=\"num neg\" title=\"5 sessions\">-0.22%</td><td class=\"num pos\">+1.55%</td><td><span class=\"sig watch sm\">🟡 Flat</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"dim-name\">U.S. 10Y</td><td class=\"num\">5.12%</td><td class=\"num pos\" title=\"5 sessions\">+3 bp</td><td class=\"num pos\">+12 bp</td><td><span class=\"sig watch sm\">🟡 Flat</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"dim-name\">S&amp;P 500</td><td class=\"num\">7,713</td><td class=\"num neg\" title=\"5 sessions\">-0.41%</td><td class=\"num pos\">+0.81%</td><td><span class=\"sig neutral sm\">⚪ Range-bound</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"dim-name\">Nasdaq</td><td class=\"num\">26,425</td><td class=\"num neg\" title=\"5 sessions\">-1.08%</td><td class=\"num neg\">-0.37%</td><td><span class=\"sig neutral sm\">⚪ Range-bound</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"dim-name\">VIX</td><td class=\"num\">17.3</td><td class=\"num pos\" title=\"5 sessions\">+5.16%</td><td class=\"num pos\">+16.88%</td><td><span class=\"sig pos sm\">🟢 Calm</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"table-note\">WoW = 7 days (crypto) / 5 sessions (markets) · MoM = 1 month.</p></section>"
