   "html": "<section class=\"block card xpulse-card\"><h2>X analyst pulse <span class=\"tag\">X · Oct 21</span></h2><div class=\"xp-verdict neg\"><div class=\"xp-verdict-main\"><span class=\"xp-verdict-lbl\">Crowd read</span><span class=\"xp-verdict-txt\">Analysts lean <strong>defensive</strong></span></div><div class=\"xp-verdict-meta\"><span class=\"xp-count pos\">1 bullish</span><span class=\"xp-count warn\">2 neutral</span><span class=\"xp-count neg\">3 bearish</span><span class=\"src-chip diverge\">Diverges with our Cautious regime</span></div></div><ul class=\"xp-list\"><li class=\"xp-item\"><a class=\"xp-thumb\" href=\"https://x.com/velo_xyz/status/2112643449208078479\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chart posted by @velo_xyz\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/x/2112643449208078479.jpg\"/></a><div class=\"xp-body\"><div class=\"xp-chips\"><span class=\"xp-sig neg\">Bearish</span><span class=\"xp-topic\">flows</span></div><p class=\"xp-take\">The Coinbase premium is at its most negative since the early-July bottom, so US spot buyers are lagging offshore markets.</p><div class=\"xp-src\"><a href=\"https://x.com/velo_xyz/status/2112643449208078479\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@velo_xyz</a><span class=\"xp-date\">Oct 20</span><a class=\"xp-open\" href=\"https://x.com/velo_xyz/status/2112643449208078479\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">View post ↗</a></div></div></li><li class=\"xp-item\"><a class=\"xp-thumb\" href=\"https://x.com/cryptoquant_com/status/2112606500153647524\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chart posted by @cryptoquant_com\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/x/2112606500153647524.jpg\"/></a><div class=\"xp-body\"><div class=\"xp-chips\"><span class=\"xp-sig neg\">Bearish</span><span class=\"xp-topic\">flows</span></div><p class=\"xp-take\">USDT supply shrank by nearly $1 billion, and if stablecoin supply keeps falling while BTC stalls, the recovery could fade before demand rebuilds.</p><div class=\"xp-src\"><a href=\"https://x.com/cryptoquant_com/status/2112606500153647524\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@cryptoquant_com</a><span class=\"xp-date\">Oct 20</span><a class=\"xp-open\" href=\"https://x.com/cryptoquant_com/status/2112606500153647524\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">View post ↗</a></div></div></li><li class=\"xp-item\"><a class=\"xp-thumb\" href=\"https://x.com/glassnode/status/2112549461016928439\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chart posted by @glassnode\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/x/2112549461016928439.jpg\"/></a><div class=\"xp-body\"><div class=\"xp-chips\"><span class=\"xp-sig pos\">Bullish</span><span class=\"xp-topic\">flows</span></div><p class=\"xp-take\">US spot bitcoin ETFs took in $663M in one day, all into IBIT, wiping out October's net outflows.</p><div class=\"xp-src\"><a href=\"https://x.com/glassnode/status/2112549461016928439\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@glassnode</a><span class=\"xp-date\">Oct 20</span><a class=\"xp-open\" href=\"https://x.com/glassnode/status/2112549461016928439\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">View post ↗</a></div></div></li><li class=\"xp-item\"><a class=\"xp-thumb\" href=\"https://x.com/Darkfost_Coc/status/2112527906337354222\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chart posted by @Darkfost_Coc\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/x/2112527906337354222.jpg\"/></a><div class=\"xp-body\"><div class=\"xp-chips\"><span class=\"xp-sig warn\">Neutral</span><span class=\"xp-topic\">on-chain</span></div><p class=\"xp-take\">Supply in profit slipped back to 53.8% after briefly topping 60%, a normal late-bear 'period of doubt' around the 50% line while confidence rebuilds.</p><div class=\"xp-src\"><a href=\"https://x.com/Darkfost_Coc/status/2112527906337354222\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@Darkfost_Coc</a><span class=\"xp-date\">Oct 20</span><a class=\"xp-open\" href=\"https://x.com/Darkfost_Coc/status/2112527906337354222\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">View post ↗</a></div></div></li><li class=\"xp-item\"><a class=\"xp-thumb\" href=\"https://x.com/ecoinometrics/status/2111810524220670378\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chart posted by @ecoinometrics\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/x/2111810524220670378.jpg\"/></a><div class=\"xp-body\"><div class=\"xp-chips\"><span class=\"xp-sig neg\">Bearish</span><span class=\"xp-topic\">macro</span></div><p class=\"xp-take\">Scoring of FOMC minutes shows the Fed's tone turning more hawkish since March, with most participants expecting another hike before year-end.</p><div class=\"xp-src\"><a href=\"https://x.com/ecoinometrics/status/2111810524220670378\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@ecoinometrics</a><span class=\"xp-date\">Oct 18</span><a class=\"xp-open\" href=\"https://x.com/ecoinometrics/status/2111810524220670378\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">View post ↗</a></div></div></li><li class=\"xp-item\"><a class=\"xp-thumb\" href=\"https://x.com/Darkfost_Coc/status/2111725402498421088\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chart posted by @Darkfost_Coc\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/x/2111725402498421088.jpg\"/></a><div class=\"xp-body\"><div class=\"xp-chips\"><span class=\"xp-sig warn\">Neutral</span><span class=\"xp-topic\">on-chain</span></div><p class=\"xp-take\">After a rejection near $87,000, BTC's <abbr class=\"gl\" title=\"Market value vs. realized value: price compared with the average cost basis of all coins. Above 1 = holders in profit on average.\" tabindex=\"0\">MVRV</abbr> fell back below its 30th percentile.</p><div class=\"xp-src\"><a href=\"https://x.com/Darkfost_Coc/status/2111725402498421088\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@Darkfost_Coc</a><span class=\"xp-date\">Oct 18</span><a class=\"xp-open\" href=\"https://x.com/Darkfost_Coc/status/2111725402498421088\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">View post ↗</a></div></div></li></ul><p class=\"xp-note\">Curated data-first analysts only · paraphrased, not advice</p></section>"
